{"seq":30,"slug":"byd","title":"比亚迪企业文化与管理哲学","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":29,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd","rating":{"composite":3.91,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.06,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 比亚迪企业文化与管理哲学 简介\n\n比亚迪（BYD）从1995年深圳一间简陋厂房中的20人电池作坊，成长为年营收超6000亿、全球新能源汽车销量冠军的科技巨头。这一历程不仅是一部商业扩张史，更是一套独特管理哲学的实践验证。王传福以工程师身份创业，将\"技术信仰\"植入企业基因——比亚迪的管理逻辑始终围绕一个核心命题：如何让一家制造企业像研发实验室一样思考和行动。\n\n本Hub从企业管理视角系统解构比亚迪的组织运作机制，适合对中国制造业管理创新、科技企业组织变革感兴趣的研究者和从业者。\n\n**第一章「文化与价值观」** 深入剖析比亚迪\"技术为王\"的核心信条、垂直整合的极端信仰、以及自主创新精神如何从口号演变为组织行为。这三者构成比亚迪区别于所有竞争对手的文化内核。\n\n**第二章「绩效体系」** 解码比亚迪如何将工程师文化转化为可量化的考核机制：以技术贡献为核心的评估框架、军事化管理所带来的极致执行力、以及渗透到每个业务单元的成本控制纪律。\n\n**第三章「组织与人才」** 聚焦王传福作为\"工程师CEO\"的管理风格如何塑造整个组织、9万+研发人员的人才密度如何维持、以及多事业部结构下内部竞争与协同的平衡术。\n\n**第四章「战略与方法论」** 分析比亚迪从矿产到整车的全产业链布局逻辑、刀片电池背后的战略赌注思维、以及从国内冠军到全球化扩张的路径选择。\n\n推荐阅读路径：先从第一章理解文化根基，再进入第二章看文化如何落地为制度，第三章理解制度背后的人与组织，最后通过第四章的战略案例验证整套管理体系的实际效果。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tech-supremacy","title":"比亚迪技术为王文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/culture-and-values/tech-supremacy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vertical-integration-belief","title":"比亚迪垂直整合信仰","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/culture-and-values/vertical-integration-belief"},{"seq":3,"slug":"self-reliance-innovation","title":"比亚迪自主创新精神","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/culture-and-values/self-reliance-innovation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"wang-chuanfu-philosophy","title":"王传福的企业家精神","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/culture-and-values/wang-chuanfu-philosophy"},{"seq":5,"slug":"mission-vision-values","title":"比亚迪使命愿景价值观体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/culture-and-values/mission-vision-values"},{"seq":6,"slug":"military-discipline-culture","title":"比亚迪的军事化管理文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/culture-and-values/military-discipline-culture"},{"seq":7,"slug":"globalization-mindset","title":"全球化心态的演变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/culture-and-values/globalization-mindset"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"绩效体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineer-oriented-eval","title":"比亚迪工程师导向考核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/performance-system/engineer-oriented-eval"},{"seq":2,"slug":"military-efficiency","title":"比亚迪军事化管理效率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/performance-system/military-efficiency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-control-discipline","title":"比亚迪成本控制纪律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/performance-system/cost-control-discipline"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wang-chuanfu-engineer-ceo","title":"王传福：工程师CEO的管理烙印","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/org-and-talent/wang-chuanfu-engineer-ceo"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rd-talent-density","title":"比亚迪研发人才密度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/org-and-talent/rd-talent-density"},{"seq":3,"slug":"division-structure","title":"比亚迪事业部组织结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/org-and-talent/division-structure"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodology","title":"战略与方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/strategy-and-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"full-chain-layout","title":"比亚迪全产业链布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/strategy-and-methodology/full-chain-layout"},{"seq":2,"slug":"blade-battery-bet","title":"刀片电池技术赌注","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/byd/strategy-and-methodology/blade-battery-bet"},{"seq":3,"slug":"globa